<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-fileshare – 격리</title><link>https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/tags/%EA%B2%A9%EB%A6%AC/</link><description>Recent content in 격리 on go-fileshare</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/tags/%EA%B2%A9%EB%A6%AC/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>프로토콜마다 하나의 프로세스</title><link>https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/operations/isolation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/operations/isolation/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;fileshare --config /etc/fileshare.d --isolate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;smb on 0.0.0.0:445 — process 19810, serving public, photos and scratch
webdav on 0.0.0.0:8080 — process 19811, serving public and photos
nfs on 0.0.0.0:2049 — process 19812, serving public&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;부모는 리스너를 바인딩한 다음 프로토콜마다 &lt;strong&gt;자기 자신을&lt;/strong&gt; 한 번씩 exec하며,각 자식에게는 해당 프로토콜이 제공할 수 있는 공유만 넘깁니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="checked-with-lsof-not-by-reading-the-code"&gt;코드를 읽어서가 아니라 &lt;code&gt;lsof&lt;/code&gt;로 확인했습니다&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="checked-with-lsof-not-by-reading-the-code"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#checked-with-lsof-not-by-reading-the-code" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;smb (pid 19810) has open: scratch.img photos.img
webdav (pid 19811) has open: photos.img
nfs (pid 19812) has open: photos.img&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;쓰기 가능한 이미지는 &lt;strong&gt;정확히 하나의 프로세스&lt;/strong&gt;에서만 열려 있으며, WebDAV
자식은 이를 전혀 열지 않습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이것이 &lt;a href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/operations/build-tags/"&gt;빌드 태그&lt;/a&gt;가 줄 수 없는 것입니다.한 프로토콜의 패닉이나 고갈된 힙은 그 프로토콜 하나만 중단시키고, 각 자식은
운영 체제가 제공하는 수단으로 가둘 수 있으며, 한 파서의 버그는 그 프로세스가
열어 본 적 없는 이미지에는 닿을 수 없습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="privileged-ports"&gt;권한이 필요한 포트&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="privileged-ports"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#privileged-ports" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unix에서는 부모가 바인딩한 리스너를 자식에게 넘기므로, &lt;strong&gt;권한이 필요한 포트도
권한 없는 자식으로 동작합니다&lt;/strong&gt;. 부모가 445를 바인딩하고 자식은 그 권한이 전혀
필요 없습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Windows에는 &lt;code&gt;ExtraFiles&lt;/code&gt;가 없으므로 자식이 직접 주소를 바인딩합니다. 격리는
같지만, 권한이 필요한 포트에 관한 절반은 해당하지 않습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-rule-that-makes-it-honest"&gt;정직하게 만드는 규칙&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-rule-that-makes-it-honest"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-rule-that-makes-it-honest" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;자식은 이미지를 직접 열므로, 두 프로토콜이 &lt;em&gt;쓰기 가능하게&lt;/em&gt; 제공하는 이미지는&lt;strong&gt;서로 간에 잠금이 없는&lt;/strong&gt; 하나의 파일 위의 두 드라이버가 됩니다. 이는 한
프로세스 안에서 &lt;a href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/operations/locking/"&gt;공유 잠금&lt;/a&gt;이 막아 주는
바로 그 상황입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이는 거부되며, 거부 메시지가 해결 방법을 알려 줍니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;scratch is writable over smb and webdav, and one process per protocol means
that many drivers writing one file with no lock between them. Say
`protocols = [&amp;#34;smb&amp;#34;]` on the share, or make it read_only, or do not isolate.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="코드 복사"
aria-label="코드 복사"
data-copied-label="복사됨!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;공유의 &lt;code&gt;protocols = [...]&lt;/code&gt;는 &lt;code&gt;--isolate&lt;/code&gt;에서만이 아니라 그 자체로도 유용합니다.SMB 전용으로 선언된 공유는 WebDAV 프로세스가 전혀 알지 못하는 공유입니다.결국 아무것도 제공하지 않게 될 &lt;code&gt;serve&lt;/code&gt; 블록도 이미지가 열리기 전에 거부되며, 그
블록에서 제외된 공유와 이유가 함께 표시됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="not-with-an-admin-or-a-metrics-block-yet"&gt;아직은 &lt;code&gt;admin&lt;/code&gt; 또는 &lt;code&gt;metrics&lt;/code&gt; 블록과 함께 쓸 수 없습니다&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="not-with-an-admin-or-a-metrics-block-yet"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#not-with-an-admin-or-a-metrics-block-yet" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;--isolate&lt;/code&gt;를 &lt;a href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/administration/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;admin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 또는&lt;a href="https://go-fileshare.github.io/docs/0.31/ko/administration/health/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;metrics&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 블록과 함께 쓰면 거부됩니다.자식이 이미지를 열고 부모는 아무것도 열지 않으므로, API 변경을 적용할 단일
프로세스도, 프로브가 준비 상태를 물을 단일 프로세스도 없기 때문입니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>